doc:FactsarticleComplexDeviceStateFeatureSelection schema1:abstract "The authors analyze how to improve equipment health state prediction by reducing the dimensionality of complex equipment condition monitoring features. A hybrid algorithm based on mutual information improves Filter and Wrapper methods and adds simulated annealing and immunization algorithms to the search strategy. The method improves feature selection efficiency, reduces feature redundancy, and improves state prediction accuracy."@en .
